    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 6 and takes 15 minutes to prepare and 45 minutes to cook. It is one of Morocco's most beloved soups, deeply nourishing and straightforward to make with nothing more than a stockpot and a handful of pantry ingredients."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: Red lentils dissolve into the broth and thicken it naturally. If you prefer a chunkier texture, add the lentils only in the last 20 minutes of cooking so they hold a little more shape."
          }
        ]
      },
